abstract: >-
  A practical enterprise reference architecture for testing and governing LLM,
  RAG, agentic AI and MCP-enabled systems as one evidence-bearing software
  system. The work defines an AI Quality Control Plane spanning conventional
  software quality, probabilistic AI evaluation, retrieval quality, agent
  trajectory quality, MCP contracts, identity and authorization, security,
  human approval, observability, performance, cost, normalized evidence,
  baseline comparison, CI/CD quality gates and production-to-regression learning.